(7613979, 1232133, 173844, '<td valign="top">Dramatic, contorted, even marionettish pose that emphatically draws the viewer in.  Her head is off by virtue of the lighting, the shadow and maybe some doctoring, but with very little imagination it still persists.  Beyond that the rich tones of her body and the fine texture of her skirt are marvelous.  The frame is amply filled.  Beautiful in its oddness.  <br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Dramatic, contorted, even marionettish pose that emphatically draws the viewer in.  Her head is off by virtue of the lighting, the shadow and maybe some doctoring, but with very little imagination it still persists.  Beyond that the rich tones of her body and the fine texture of her skirt are marvelous.  The frame is amply filled.  Beautiful in its oddness.  Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2019-02-17 23:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7613983, 1232404, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely dreamscape, tawny and furry.  The heads are sort of not there.  A feel of golden autumn, the walkers well into the day, leaving us to our own devices in this happy gift, this unfettered breadth of time.</td>', 'Lovely dreamscape, tawny and furry.  The heads are sort of not there.  A feel of golden autumn, the walkers well into the day, leaving us to our own devices in this happy gift, this unfettered breadth of time.', '2019-02-17 23:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7613985, 1232189, 173844, '<td valign="top">Like vaudevillians hoofing with their shadows offstage.  So much enjoyable rhythm and movement here, the couple and the planking and the water.  Lovely tones and contrasts.  Excellent black and white.</td>', 'Like vaudevillians hoofing with their shadows offstage.  So much enjoyable rhythm and movement here, the couple and the planking and the water.  Lovely tones and contrasts.  Excellent black and white.', '2019-02-17 23:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
